1
00:00:00,183 --> 00:00:01,340
He froze the woman he loved,

2
00:00:01,340 --> 00:00:02,490
to save her life.

3
00:00:02,700 --> 00:00:04,306
Then his boss pulled the plug.

4
00:00:04,306 --> 00:00:05,620
This is Gotham City,

5
00:00:05,620 --> 00:00:07,000
run by crime and money,

6
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:08,360
where a masked vigilante called

7
00:00:08,360 --> 00:00:10,091
Batman hunts criminals by night.

8
00:00:10,091 --> 00:00:12,180
Victor Fries was a scientist at GothCorp,

9
00:00:12,180 --> 00:00:13,050
a giant company.

10
00:00:13,260 --> 00:00:15,840
His work was cryogenics: freezing a living body,

11
00:00:15,840 --> 00:00:17,554
so time stops inside it.

12
00:00:17,554 --> 00:00:18,240
His wife, Nora,

13
00:00:18,240 --> 00:00:19,220
was dying of an illness

14
00:00:19,220 --> 00:00:20,524
no doctor could cure.

15
00:00:20,524 --> 00:00:22,140
So Victor froze her in a glass chamber,

16
00:00:22,140 --> 00:00:23,230
to wait for a cure.

17
00:00:23,480 --> 00:00:24,480
He kept a snow globe

18
00:00:24,480 --> 00:00:26,220
with a tiny skater inside.

19
00:00:26,220 --> 00:00:27,552
To him, it was Nora.

20
00:00:27,552 --> 00:00:28,990
But he'd used the company's machines.

21
00:00:29,220 --> 00:00:31,838
The boss, Ferris Boyle, ordered them shut off.

22
00:00:31,838 --> 00:00:32,670
Victor begged.

23
00:00:33,060 --> 00:00:34,060
Boyle kicked him into the freezing

24
00:00:34,060 --> 00:00:35,312
chemicals, and ran.

25
00:00:35,642 --> 00:00:37,100
Nora's chamber went dark.

26
00:00:37,100 --> 00:00:38,643
Victor believed she was gone.

27
00:00:39,075 --> 00:00:40,840
The chemicals changed his body.

28
00:00:40,840 --> 00:00:42,580
Now he could only survive below zero,

29
00:00:42,580 --> 00:00:44,213
inside a frozen suit.

30
00:00:44,213 --> 00:00:45,720
He became Mister Freeze,

31
00:00:45,720 --> 00:00:46,720
and he hunted GothCorp

32
00:00:46,720 --> 00:00:48,833
to find the man who killed his wife.

33
00:00:48,833 --> 00:00:50,120
Batman stopped him just before

34
00:00:50,120 --> 00:00:51,510
he froze Boyle alive.

35
00:00:51,720 --> 00:00:53,080
Then he found the security tape,

36
00:00:53,080 --> 00:00:54,529
and gave it to the news.

37
00:00:54,529 --> 00:00:55,830
That explains his revenge.

38
00:00:56,060 --> 00:00:57,168
It doesn't excuse it.

39
00:00:57,462 --> 00:00:58,540
Locked in a cell,

40
00:00:58,540 --> 00:00:59,680
Victor held the snow globe,

41
00:00:59,680 --> 00:01:00,620
and asked Nora

42
00:01:00,620 --> 00:01:02,175
to forgive him for failing her.

43
00:01:02,615 --> 00:01:04,520
He could freeze anything in the world.

44
00:01:04,520 --> 00:01:05,320
But the only thing

45
00:01:05,320 --> 00:01:07,396
he ever wanted to keep was her.
